 $527 million&#160;loss and a $605 million&#160;loss, respectively, were reported in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Other comprehensive income/(loss), net of tax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;. For the second quarter and first half of 2026, a $93 million&#160;gain and a $229 million gain, respectively, were reported in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Other comprehensive income/(loss), net of tax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18pt"&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;(b)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:8.24pt"&gt;For the second quarter and first half of 2025, a $12 million gain and an $8 million gain, respectively, were reported in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Other comprehensive income/(loss), net of tax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;. For the second quarter and first half of 2026, a $38 million loss and a $40 million gain, respectively, were reported in &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;Other comprehensive income/(loss), net of tax&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%"&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style="padding-left:18pt;text-indent:-18p